<title>USA: Parker Drilling buys Energy Venture unit.</title>
<headline>Parker Drilling buys Energy Venture unit.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Drilling Co said Monday it has signed a definitive agreement to buy Mallary Bay Drilling, a subsidiary of Energy Ventures Inc, for $338 million.</p>
<p>Parker said it would finance the acquisition by issuing debt.</p>
<p>Mallard Bay is based in New Iberia, La., and owns 47 barge and platform rigs, most of them in the Gulf Coast.</p>
</text>
